\viewkind4\pard\cf1\fs32\b Help, portability and shortcuts\b0\fs22\par\par
\pard\sa120 The proposed manual is embedded in NetTools. Reading it will not require an internet connection, a separate help file, or a browser runtime.\par
\pard\sa180\sb120\b\fs28 Proposed help controls\b0\fs22\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa80 \u8226? \b F1:\b0  open the topic for the current tool or focused field.\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa80 \u8226? \b Contents:\b0  browse the complete manual.\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa80 \u8226? \b Search:\b0  find words, commands, examples and error messages.\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa80 \u8226? \b Back / Forward:\b0  retrace the topics you opened.\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa80 \u8226? \b Copy:\b0  copy example addresses and selected text.\par
\pard\sa120 Online reference links open in your default browser only when selected. Saved plans and exported results are user-created files; they are not runtime dependencies.\par
\pard\sa120 Core portability, keyboard behaviour and error recovery will each have dedicated chapters in the final manual.\par
